# Crafted Dancer Artifact (hidden quest DncArtifact): a level 99 Dancer (race 1, Hume male: getGender 1, the male
# pieces) in Upper Jeuno, The Road to Divadom completed and HQuest[DncArtifact]Prog 1 (GMs: that quest's completion
# writes it). Olgald (default 10122): Prog 1: 10167 (Prog 2, Status 7); Prog 2: 10168 once per zone, then his default.
# Bastok Markets, Matthias (default 499): Prog 2: 492, finished on 1: Option 1, Prog 4. Prog 4: 494 (0). A trade of the
# tiara's three cloths plus a fourth item: nothing (tradeHasExactly); the three: 495 (0), finished: confirmed, Timer
# tomorrow, Prog 5. 496 (not yet). Timer past (a GM): 497 (Dancer's Tiara (M), 0), finished: the tiara, Status 6, Prog
# 3. 493 (1, 0, 0), finished on 0: nothing; on 1 (made): nothing; on 3: Option 3, Prog 4. 494 (2).
# The Timer set to today (a GM) counts as past: the check is Timer <= today.
lists UpperJeuno/Olgald/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10167 BastokMarkets/Matthias/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Matthias/onTrade BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/492 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/493 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/495 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/497
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-53,0,101.9 job=DNC lvl=99 race=1
quest Jeuno.TheRoadToDivadom completed
charvar HQuest[DncArtifact]Prog 1
item SquareOfImperialSilkCloth
item SquareOfWolfFelt
item SquareOfSilverBrocade
item FireCrystal
item SquareOfKarakulCloth
item SquareOfRainbowCloth
item SquareOfRainbowVelvet
login
trigger Olgald                          # Prog 1: 10167
finish                                  # Prog 2, Status 7
trigger Olgald                          # Prog 2: 10168 (once per zone)
finish
trigger Olgald                          # once per zone spent: 10122
finish
warp -114.1,-4.3,-105.8 BastokMarkets   # beside Matthias
trade Matthias SquareOfImperialSilkCloth x1 SquareOfWolfFelt x1 SquareOfSilverBrocade x1   # Prog 2: nothing
trigger Matthias                        # Prog 2: 492
finish option=1                         # Option 1, Prog 4
trigger Matthias                        # Prog 4: 494 (0)
finish
trade Matthias SquareOfImperialSilkCloth x1 SquareOfWolfFelt x1 SquareOfSilverBrocade x1 FireCrystal x1   # not exactly: nothing
trade Matthias SquareOfImperialSilkCloth x1 SquareOfWolfFelt x1 SquareOfSilverBrocade x1   # 495 (0)
finish                                  # confirmed, Timer tomorrow, Prog 5
trigger Matthias                        # Prog 5, not yet: 496
finish
charvar HQuest[DncArtifact]Timer 8000   # a GM: the Timer is today (the check is Timer <= today)
trigger Matthias                        # 497 (the tiara (M), 0)
finish                                  # the tiara; Status 6, Prog 3
trigger Matthias                        # Prog 3: 493 (1, 0, 0)
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Matthias                        # 493
finish option=1                         # the tiara made: nothing
trigger Matthias                        # 493
finish option=3                         # Option 3, Prog 4
trigger Matthias                        # 494 (2)
finish
charvar HQuest[DncArtifact]Option 2     # a GM: the bangles
trade Matthias SquareOfKarakulCloth x1 SquareOfRainbowCloth x1 SquareOfRainbowVelvet x1   # 495 (1)
finish                                  # confirmed, Timer tomorrow, Prog 5
charvar HQuest[DncArtifact]Timer 0      # a GM: the day past
trigger Matthias                        # 497 (the bangles (M), 0)
finish                                  # the bangles; Status 4, Prog 3
